<!--
  Eventara sitemap.

  Only pages a signed-out visitor can actually see are listed. The seven
  supplier pages are included individually: they are the site's real
  indexable content and the main way a search for a venue name reaches
  Eventara. They are served by one file (supplier.html) parameterised by
  ?slug=, which is a legitimate distinct URL per supplier.

  Regenerate the supplier entries from:
    select slug from v_supplier_public order by business_name;
-->
